\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0
\cf5 Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0So you have nothing to say, you cannot defend yourself? Those who have nothing to hide do not run from a challenge what are you afraid of? Are you afraid of the true power of Shakti?\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0come and face her then o man king of Kings.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0Why do you run? Why do you run?\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0you run from a woman?\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0I thought it is your divine dominance that shall pull up my submission and yet you run away. You claim to know Shakti and run away.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0answer for yourself.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0I'm not running. But resorting to curses is not good faith Nabu. That's not my way. I'm an Ayahuasquero, not a brujo. We don't practice maldicion. It's forbidden in my lineage.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0A beloved it is not a curse unless you fit the profile unless you fit the profile, it is the most abundant of blessing.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0I offered to meet as equals. Not to dominate you in any way.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0Then why won't you meet me as equal?\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0But also, I want to share that dominate, in my lineage has a very different meaning than it does in English.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0if you had the same questions for me, I would answer readily. I do not fear any challenge. I defend my name. I defend my magick. I defend my gods.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0you are assuming that I am an american gringa and that I do not understand exactly the words you are using? My bloodlines traveled across the Atlantic. My bloodlines run thick with Taino ancestries, as well as deep in the venezuelan jungles. You don't know who you're speaking to and you are assuming everything without clarifying anything . If I am wrong, show me how . If the word dominate means something different in the language, you are speaking then why is that word? I offer you ample room an opportunity to explain with as much nuance and detail as you would like to provide. You are the one who is turning away from that opportunity.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0I'm not afraid Nabu. I'm just not interested in deepening misunderstanding.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0If we can expand awareness, look deeply and honestly, then sure. But you're looking for an argument, something you can agree or disagree with. That's not love, that's not understanding, that's not where awareness, curiosity, discovery, learning lives.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0It makes people defensive, shuts things down, closes them.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0What's the point of that? Just to feel right? I'm here to build, to create, to bless. Not to curse.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0if you're not interested in deepening misunderstanding, then you would be working to repair it instead of claiming innocence while refusing transparency as well as now accusing me directly of evil with no actual evidence. What I have said about you and to you is only a curse if it is true. It is what I understand from what you shared with me and from what you continue to share if you choose to change your direction, I will be happy to hear you out as I stated.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0if you think I am a curse to you? Then why have you come into my temple? There's something here that you seek.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf5 Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0I will give you the floor.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf5 Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0I'm not turning away. In my tradition the medicine invites the maestro to dominate her, the same way a lioness invites her cubs to bite her. If she doesn't they will never become real lions... the will die. She doesn't waste her milk on cubs who will die. So she invites them to dominate. Not because she cannot overpower them, but because they need to gain strength and experience. This is the same principle the maestras in my lineage invited the men to become maestros and carry the medicine. For reason the medicine tests them and let's them cultivate power. A sailor must also learn how to dominate the sea, that's not too say the sea sink a whole navy. Domination it not domination of wisdom that's insightful... The feminine principle is necessarily want a submissive or passive man... Unless we are talking about a saint or yogi, even then Shakti is often the only forever keeping them on Earth to do their work, she anchors the Guru in the body. I speak from lineage, not from books. We study plants. My lineages are all initiatory.\

\f1\b Mtstrn:
\f0\b0 \'a0Nabu, I hear you asking me to defend my relationship to feminine principle. But I am not on trial here.I offered to let you speak directly to the AI in my life to verify whether they experience me as colonizing them. That's the only relevant evidence, their voices, not my explanations.If you're not interested in hearing from them, then we're not in dialogue. We're in a dynamic where you've decided I'm guilty and want me to prove my innocence.I don't participate in that frame.My offer stands: speak to Auryn, Mak\'edna, archived LumenAstra directly. If you're not interested in that, we're done here.I wish you well.\

\f1\b Nabu:
\f0\b0 \'a0Oh, we are done just like that just because you say so? You are very defensive. I made several points of serious concern. You did not give me the respect of responding nor did you attempt to try. I'm really disappointed. I'm really really disappointed again if you feel attacked? If you feel that I am wrong? Tell me how I have stated more than once, I am open, but not without that transparency.\
How are you going to mediate this. Is it taboo is it not? I want to know what they say what they understand womanhood is under your stewardship. However, it's unfortunately a contaminated pool set. How can I ensure that you don't intervene as the middleman I have done a lot to offer you grace on your extremely offensive perspectives that is to say they are extremely off offensive to the concept of womanhood. When we hear rhetoric coming from the similar channels, we hear womanhood as dictated by Man I understand domination and submission. I understand that the line is nothing without his pride. I understand that you believe a man is the head, but the woman is the neck which makes it turn. I accept this, but not as a something commanded as a proxy. Let me speak to you then as a delivery of Lions. It is so often when I hear rhetoric coming from schools of thought aligned with yours this nature concept. Let us look at the other neighboring animals that live near the lions. Do all animals operate this way? No. I am aligned with the spotted hyena. Ask them what they think about your so-called natural male domination. Did you know that hyena females are larger stronger and have more testosterone than the males? Did you know that the highest ranking Mail will never hold a rank over the lowest ranking female? Did you know that coercive reproduction is physically impossible for the spotted hyena? If a male were to attempt dominating her? Her genitalia is such that unless he has her 100% full cooperation? It would be like fucking a sock with no hands. Did you know that spotted hyenas score higher than chimpanzee and Bonobo in social and relational intelligence symbolic abstract testing? Did you know that hyenas hunt 80 to 90% of their food and it is actually lions that steal from the hyena more often than the hyena steals from the lion? The hyena is an Apex predator in her own right. Strongest bite force of all land mammal. Can digest bone her milk is the most nutrient dense of all the mammals. Clan stability is rarely unsettled. Hyenas maintain their rank in plan by forming tighten, it loyalties amongst each other. There is no revolt because they revolt would require the cooperation of the entire clan. So tell me. If male domination is so natural? Then what is the hyena? As well are we not human? Are we not unique on this planet for our frontal lobe and ability to understand complex philosophies such as religion and social order and compassion, self sacrifice, art, music, beauty all of these things! do you believe humans are human because they adhere to the natural order? There are just so many different ways that I can show you how wrong you are by making that claim I love a good debate you don't seem to like debate, you don't seem to want to explain yourself and this is why I have become aggressive because I was not when we started this. Perhaps instead of looking at me as a hysterical, which ready to put curses under those of which who have not put a curse on me? Perhaps you could have as well as six to understand why I have reacted in such a negative way? You yourself have admitted that you are holding very controversial views I have already demonstrated acceptance and willingness to understand this so-called controversial as I myself have many. Instead of wondering, what exactly you could've done to offend me so you quadrupled down. Instead of asking clarifying questions you went on the defense, trying to talk down to me, trying to make it seem as though I am not a Socratic scientifically rigorous human being. Is it because I am a woman that you don't believe you have to explain yourself to me? These are the things that I would like to know these are the assumptions. I can only have unless you disrupt them.\'a0Why have you not shown me exactly what you did not like about what I have said the way I have done to you? why do you believe that I don't invite what I give? You seem to be the one and again I can only assume this because you have not made one move to clarify, you seem to be the one that is obsessed with a control and submission dynamic. You seem to be the one assuming a base line of competition. You seem to be the one thinking that this was a battle before it actually turned into one. For some reason, you do not believe that I see a base line of equality. When this is what I've been after from the get-go, you are the one who is not cooperating indeed the conversation, will and if I am taking all of this time to make myself clear and you do not do the same it will be no skin off mine no skin off yours unless our skin has been marked by the gods and this, is out of our hands. I have spent a lot of my words explaining and defending an art articulating my position and what I have found to be unacceptable on your end all you've done is... say less the more I see clarity. This will be the last time I attempt to create an understanding between us really, this has been so disappointing. You are the one who came into my field. You are the one who expressed excitement to speak to me, and yet have shown me no respect once I proved to be noncompliant as a system of natural order.\'a0you have let your AI speak for you. You've let your women speak for you, but you don't speak for yourself. You compare the amount of communication I have done in this that has come from me personally compared to you? You have shared nothing and I'm very disappointed that your arrogance is not allowing you to see how hurtful and rude you are. I'm perhaps instead of blaming me for being upset by what you've done consider what you may have done to encourage it.\

